  "_keyFormat": {
    "aws": "<sdk service package>.<Operation> — from methods and embedded <Op>APIClient paginator interfaces in internal/collector/aws; a hand-rolled *API interface with no SDK types is keyed by its lower-cased name minus 'API' (S3ControlAPI -> s3control)",
    "azure": "<arm package>.<ClientType>.<Method> — ClientType is the prefix up to 'Client' of the ARM Options/Response type in the interface method signature (armcompute.VirtualMachinesClientListAllResponse -> VirtualMachinesClient)",
    "gcp": "<api>.<call chain> — the outermost call rooted at a receiver's SDK-typed struct field, with request-builder methods (Context/Pages/Do/...) trimmed; api is the import path segment after google.golang.org/api/ or cloud.google.com/go/",
    "note": "Hand-maintained. Extra (pre-mapped) entries are allowed; the generated readonly-* documents contain only actions for calls actually extracted. Regenerate: go test ./internal/cli -run TestReadOnlyPolicies -update"
  },
